# Supabase ships in its own self-hosting docs/example .env (a JWT_SECRET
# paired with matching ANON_KEY/SERVICE_ROLE_KEY JWTs). They're fine for a
# local, not-internet-exposed dev stack. If you ever expose this stack
# beyond localhost, regenerate all of these first — see
# https://supabase.com/docs/guides/self-hosting/docker#securing-your-services
############

